    [
     2,
     "On 05/26/2014 06:17 PM, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">peter....@gmail.com</a> wrote:\r<br>&gt; Thanks for your help Terry and Yves. I&#39;ll keep looking into what&#39;s going\r<br>&gt; on. Knowing that the sem() function should take care of it is very\r<br>&gt; helpful. I thought lavaan was doing something incorrectly as it is\r<br>&gt; having trouble computing my standard errors and test statistics, and I\r<br>&gt; have been able to fit this model well in EQS. It&#39;s possible that I am\r<br>&gt; incorrectly specifying my model. I&#39;ll continue investigating.\r<br>\r<br>"
